      "text": "Numerical stabilization.\nBefore selecting the budget, we first translate the raw\nsampled soft bonus in (4.10) into the coordinate system used by a finite rollout group.\nRaw completion probabilities \u00af\u03c0(k) can be extremely small, so the implementation uses\ngroup-normalized probabilities. Within each sampled group we set\n",
